SOAPBOX: My first SSB contest in over 20 years. After a long search, I finally found my old logging program again—back then it was called K1ea or CT, but today it’s called DX Log (thanks to the operators who kept it going). It felt familiar, so I didn’t have to look far. N1mm and others seemed too bloated to me at first glance I’ll have to look into them. Otherwise, it was fun. There aren’t many QSs, but I’m slowly getting back into the fun of contests. Thanks to everyone, vy 73 de ju
